  "title": "Balsamic Grilled Baby Potatoes",
  "description": "These grilled mini potatoes are cooked in a foil packet with balsamic vinegar, olive oil, onion powder, and butter, for a quick and easy side when grilling.",
  "authors": [
    "CanadianCook"
  ],
